      "content": "You should absolutely not change your Lisinopril dosage without first consulting your prescribing physician. Feeling lightheaded and dizzy could be a sign of blood pressure dropping too low, or it could be related to other factors. Please contact your doctor's office immediately to discuss your symptoms and your recent blood pressure readings before making any adjustments.",
      "source": "target",
